WEBVTT

00:17:28.198 --> 00:17:31.661
osetio tračak hladnoće,
nerve kako se bude,

00:17:31.661 --> 00:17:36.948
bilo je neverovatno, nalet snega.

00:17:36.948 --> 00:17:40.184
Ali nisam ove stvari rekao Abedu.

00:17:40.184 --> 00:17:44.985
Rekao sam mu da je ubio
samo jednog čoveka, ne dvoje.

00:17:44.985 --> 00:17:49.459
Rekao sam mu ime tog čoveka.

00:17:49.459 --> 00:17:53.272
A onda sam rekao: "Zbogom."

00:17:53.272 --> 00:17:55.189
Hvala vam.

00:17:55.189 --> 00:18:01.924
(Aplauz)